:함초롬바탕;\">신규</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">기존</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">★</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">취업동아리 신청요건</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">취업동아리 구성요건</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">본교 재학생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">명 이상으로 구성되어야 함 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">대학원생 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">휴학생 및 미취업 졸업생은 구성원의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">30% </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">이하로 함</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">취업 및 진로와 관련하여 뚜렷한 목적성이 있어야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">취업동아리 구성분야</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">특정기업 및 그룹사의 진출</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">특정 업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">직종의 진출</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">기타 취업과 관련된 분야</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">신청기간</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#ff0000;\">○ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#ff0000;\">2023.5.1(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;color:#ff0000;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#ff0000;\">) ~ 5.12(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;color:#ff0000;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#ff0000;\">) 18:00</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">신청방법</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">○ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">E-</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">메일 접수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><a href=\"mailto:shk@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#ff0000;\">shk@kumoh.ac.kr</span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">메일 제목형식 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">: [</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">동아리명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">] </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">취업동아리 지원신청</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">구비서류</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">취업동아리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">자율동아리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">] </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">등록신청서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">활동계획서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">회원명부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">첨부파일 양식</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><u>기존동아리도 다시 재등록 신청을 해야하며&nbsp;</u></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; 실적 제출시</span><u> 재신청동아리 실적제출 양식(첨부파일 양식)에 기재 후 제출하면 됨</u></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(단, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2022년&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">동아리 회원으로 활동한</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b>&nbsp;회원들의 실적을 기재)</b></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">5) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">동아리 선정 및 평가</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">적격성 여부와 활동계획</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">활동내용 및 실적 등에 대하여 평가를 실시하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">그 결과에 따라 활동비 지원 규모 및 계속 지원 여부를 결정</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">취업동아리 활동계획 발표는 서면심사로 대체할 수 있으며 발표 진행 시 사전 안내 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">   </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">활동비는 최종 선발 후부터 지원 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">소급적용 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">6) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">문의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학생성공처 취업지원팀 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">054-478-7985</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"20114\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5656\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"USER-PC\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2023-04-28T16:08:53.614Z\",\n\"md\": \"2023-04-28T16:08:53.636Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\"cd\": {\n\"tp\": 0,\n\"lc\": {\n\"af\": false,\n\"ui\": false,\n\"fu\": false,\n\"dn\": false,\n\"ul\": false,\n\"el\": false,\n\"at\": false,\n\"tq\": false,\n\"da\": false,\n\"dw\": false,\n\"dj\": false,\n\"bc\": false,\n\"bu\": false,\n\"al\": false,\n\"ab\": false,\n\"ap\": false,\n\"an\": false,\n\"aa\": false,\n\"ds\": false,\n\"de\": false,\n\"as\": false,\n\"cp\": false,\n\"ao\": false,\n\"et\": false,\n\"ay\": false,\n\"am\": false,\n\"a1\": false,\n\"bt\": false,\n\"av\": false,\n\"dh\": false,\n\"dp\": false,\n\"d1\": false,\n\"mf\": false,\n\"bl\": false,\n\"ag\": false,\n\"dg\": false,\n\"ae\": false,\n\"df\": false,\n\"do